  "feature_source": "Rule-based cleaning; closest retained pair's centroid_distance_px and d_orbital_rad_s, offsets -60..+60. Missing or abs>15 orbital rates become 0 in raw windows. Three additional per-frame signals: signed distance change (px/s), signed orbital-rate change (rad/s^2), and head-to-head/tail-to-tail segment-intersection speed (px/s). All five signals are flattened at every window offset, with no averaging. Each derivative at frame t uses consecutive same-pair frames t-1 and t at 30 fps, including a preceding context frame for the window's leftmost offset. Missing measurements, pair switches, and episode changes invalidate derivatives. No unique finite segment intersection or invalid consecutive step yields NaN.",
